text: ["Aeronaut Tinkerer has flying as long as you control an artifact. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Chandra's Fury deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker and 1 damage to each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", "Flying\\nWhen Kor Skyfisher enters the battlefield, return a permanent you control to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'Whenever Stealer of Secrets deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', '{U}, {T}: Target player mills two cards.']
